   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{5FA2F7F08B72FDB5}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "Leaderboard Computers Searched"\
     "Scout: 1"\
     ""\
     "Two opposing contracted forces deploy from separate aircraft carriers and compete to locate, capture, and extract a single High Value Target (HVT), while an Independent protection element works to keep the HVT free and alive. "\
     ""\
     "During a past incident, Lunchyyy muted TheLocalPub. Shortly afterward, Pub teamkilled a third party and claimed the muting caused a communication failure. Pub said video evidence existed, but it was never released. Intelligence suggests the footage may contradict that claim. Lunchyyy has resurfaced and is attempting to recover the missing video, prompting a paid capture effort that has drawn multiple armed groups into the area."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4657CCC9807F6B23}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "TheLocalFiles"
     m_sContent "Description text"
     m_eAudience 3
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3D621C42AC52238D}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "Enemy Forces"\
     "Rival Contracted Force: Another paid military team attempting to capture HVT Lunchyyy for their own extraction."\
     "Independent Security Forces (INDFOR): Dedicated protection element for the HVT. INDFOR forces are always hostile and will actively interfere with any attempt to capture or extract the HVT."\
     ""\
     "Friendly Forces"\
     "Your team: Tasked with locating, capturing, and extracting the HVT."\
     "USS Charlie Kirk: Your aircraft carrier and extraction platform."\
     "3 MH-6 Little Bird transport helicopters available for insertion, maneuver, and extraction."\
     ""\
     "Background"\
     "In a past incident, Lunchyyy muted TheLocalPub during a match. Shortly afterward, Pub teamkilled a third party and later claimed the action occurred because he could not hear information due to being muted. Pub stated a video existed supporting his claim, but the footage was never released."\
     ""\
     "Intelligence suggests the video may show Pub committing the teamkill first, then later blaming the muting. Lunchyyy is now attempting to locate this missing footage by accessing computer systems across the AO."\
     ""\
     "To prevent the video from being recovered, TheLocalPub arranged a paid capture contract, drawing multiple competing forces toward Lunchyyy."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DDD9F5DC41868222}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "TELL THE HVT TO PICK UP THE RED FOLDER WHEN YOU START. DO NOT LET HIM DROP IT."\
     ""\
     "You are NOT bound by any setup or briefing timer."\
     ""\
     "Enemy Forces"\
     "Two rival contracted military teams are operating in the AO with the sole objective of capturing and extracting the HVT (Lunchyyy)."\
     "These forces are well-equipped, mobile, and may engage each other if it supports HVT capture."\
     ""\
     "Friendly Forces"\
     "Your team (INDFOR): Dedicated protection element assigned to the HVT. You spawn at the airfield."\
     ""\
     "The HVT has an active mission (survive, evade capture, and search computers), and your objective is to enable that mission."\
     "Your role is to create the conditions for the HVT to move, relocate, and reach objectives safely, not to keep him static or concealed indefinitely. Computers are marked on the map after 5 minutes with red dots."\
     ""\
     "ION success is measured by how effectively you:"\
     "Preserve the HVT’s life"\
     ""\
     "Enable continued movement and decision-making"\
     ""\
     "Deny capture while supporting the HVT’s objectives"\
     ""\
     "Passive hiding, excessive stalling, or preventing the HVT from acting runs counter to mission intent."\
     ""\
     ""\
     "Background"\
     "A disputed past incident involving TheLocalPub may be contradicted by unreleased video footage. To prevent that footage from being recovered, a paid capture contract was arranged, drawing multiple armed groups toward the HVT."\
     ""\
     "Your team’s sole purpose is to keep the HVT free and alive."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_ION"
     }
    }
