    GC_Briefing "{71F57D86ED312DBE}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Execution"
     m_sContent "Your team spawns on the USS Charlie Kirk."\
     ""\
     "Conduct search and maneuver operations to locate the HVT."\
     ""\
     "Excessive fighting between contracted teams may cause both teams to fail to secure the HVT."\
     ""\
     "Mission-maker intent prioritizes capture, restraint, and decision-making."\
     ""\
     "INDFOR forces are always hostile."\
     ""\
     "A map marker showing the HVT’s approximate location updates every five minutes."\
     ""\
     "Killing the HVT is prohibited."\
     ""\
     "If the HVT is killed, your team may extract the red intelligence folder for a minor success only."\
     ""\
     "HVT Compliance Rule:"\
     "If the HVT is ordered to stop and cannot reasonably escape or evade, he must surrender."\
     "If the HVT attempts to flee while clearly surrounded or cornered, lethal force is authorized due to violation of mission intent. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E4036A30F38F6504}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "GRAB THE RED INTEL ON THE DESK WHEN YOU SPAWN, NEVER DROP IT."\
     ""\
     "You are HVT Lunchyyy. You spawn at the airfield. Two rival contracted military teams are actively attempting to locate, capture, and extract you. An Independent Security Detail (INDFOR) is assigned to protect you and will actively interfere with capture attempts."\
     "Your actions directly influence the pace and outcome of the mission."\
     ""\
     ""\
     ""\
     "You are competing against previous HVT players across playthroughs."\
     "Track how many computers you search without being captured."\
     "If you beat the previous capture record, report the new time to Wade (Mission Maker) after the mission."\
     "If you die, your record becomes invalid."\
     "You cannot win the mission; this is a survival benchmark only."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "CIV"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{234C32D8D8004FC2}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "Execution"
     m_sContent "TELL THE HVT TO PICK UP THE RED FOLDER WHEN YOU START. DO NOT LET HIM DROP IT."\
     ""\
     "Your team is a full-time protection element and is always hostile to both contracted forces."\
     ""\
     "You are NOT bound by any setup or briefing timer."\
     ""\
     "You may move immediately at mission start."\
     "It is strongly recommended that you begin driving around the island immediately, as:"\
     "Enemy knows where you spawn"\
     "Computers will not spawn for the first five minutes"\
     "Early movement reduces the risk of encirclement"\
     "After five minutes, computer locations will spawn and be marked on the map."\
     "Maintain close protection of the HVT at all times."\
     "Actively interfere with capture attempts using movement, blocking, deception, and force as required."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_ION"
     }
    }
